id: pm-lppm6y
title: "GH-956: lossless acceptance-criteria replacement and unmatched-removal failure contract"
description: Prevent a composed remove-and-replace update from silently discarding unrelated acceptance criteria; make destructive and unmatched list mutations explicit and machine-actionable.
type: Issue
status: in_progress
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-08-09T22:12:37.531Z"
updated_at: "2026-08-10T08:53:29.546Z"
